<%- include('partials/head', { title: null }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { active: 'home' }) %>

<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero__tagline">Where MIS graduates stay connected.</p>
  <h1>MIS Alumni Portal</h1>
  <p class="hero__lead">
    The alumni tracking system and community portal for graduates of the Istanbul University,
    Faculty of Economics, Department of Management Information Systems. One place for the
    department's graduate records, announcements, and career opportunities.
  </p>
  <div class="hero__actions">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/users">Browse alumni</a>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/api-docs">API documentation</a>
  </div>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">What is in the portal today</h2>

<div class="card-grid">
  <article class="card">
    <h3 class="card__title">Alumni directory</h3>
    <p class="card__meta">The core tracking system</p>
    <p class="card__body">
      Every graduate on record, with their username and email. This is the data the department
      maintains for accreditation and for keeping in touch.
    </p>
    <div class="card__footer">
      <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="/users">Open directory</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <h3 class="card__title">Announcements</h3>
    <p class="card__meta">Community and communication</p>
    <p class="card__body">
      Notices published to the alumni community: reunions, deadlines, department news, and
      calls for volunteers.
    </p>
    <div class="card__footer">
      <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="/announcements">Read announcements</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <h3 class="card__title">Job postings</h3>
    <p class="card__meta">Career services</p>
    <p class="card__body">
      Opportunities shared by alumni and partner companies, with applications tracked against
      each posting.
    </p>
    <div class="card__footer">
      <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="/job-postings">See postings</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">For developers</h2>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card__body">
    Every screen has a JSON equivalent under <code>/api</code>. The OpenAPI specification is
    served by Swagger UI at <a href="/api-docs">/api-docs</a>, and the health endpoint at
    <a href="/api/health">/api/health</a> reports uptime.
  </p>
  <div class="card__footer">
    <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="/api-docs">Open Swagger UI</a>
    <a class="btn btn--link" href="/api/users">GET /api/users</a>
    <a class="btn btn--link" href="/api/job-postings">GET /api/job-postings</a>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
